   "source": [
    "# 🤖 Azure OpenAI Service — Lab AI-102\n",
    "\n",
    "**Objectif**: Utiliser Azure OpenAI pour les tâches de gestion documentaire.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Compétences AI-102 couvertes\n",
    "- Configurer et utiliser Azure OpenAI deployments\n",
    "- Implémenter le pattern RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation)\n",
    "- Ingénierie de prompts (roles system/user/assistant)\n",
    "- Conversations multi-tours avec historique\n",
    "- Génération de documents structurés\n",
    "- Classification zero-shot\n",
    "- Génération d'embeddings pour la recherche sémantique\n",
    "- Contrôler température et tokens"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "%pip install openai python-dotenv -q"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import os\n",
    "from dotenv import load_dotenv\n",
    "from openai import AzureOpenAI\n",
    "\n",
    "load_dotenv('../.env')\n",
    "\n",
    "client = AzureOpenAI(\n",
    "    azure_endpoint=os.getenv('AZURE_OPENAI_ENDPOINT'),\n",
    "    api_key=os.getenv('AZURE_OPENAI_API_KEY'),\n",
    "    api_version=os.getenv('AZURE_OPENAI_API_VERSION', '2024-02-15-preview')\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "CHAT_MODEL = os.getenv('AZURE_OPENAI_CHAT_DEPLOYMENT', 'gpt-4o')\n",
    "EMBEDDING_MODEL = os.getenv('AZURE_OPENAI_EMBEDDING_DEPLOYMENT', 'text-embedding-ada-002')\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'✅ Client Azure OpenAI initialisé. Modèle chat: {CHAT_MODEL}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Chat Completion — Roles et Messages"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# AI-102: Les messages ont 3 rôles:\n",
    "# - system: définit le comportement et le contexte de l'assistant\n",
    "# - user: la requête de l'utilisateur\n",
    "# - assistant: les réponses précédentes (pour le contexte multi-tour)\n",
    "\n",
    "response = client.chat.completions.create(\n",
    "    model=CHAT_MODEL,\n",
    "    messages=[\n",
    "        {\n",
    "            \"role\": \"system\",\n",
    "            \"content\": \"Tu es un expert en analyse documentaire. Tes réponses sont concises et structurées.\"\n",
    "        },\n",
    "        {\n",
    "            \"role\": \"user\",\n",
    "            \"content\": \"Quels sont les éléments clés d'un contrat de prestation de services?\"\n",
    "        }\n",
    "    ],\n",
    "    max_tokens=500,\n",
    "    temperature=0.3  # Faible = plus déterministe, élevé = plus créatif\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Réponse:\")\n",
    "print(response.choices[0].message.content)\n",
    "print(f\"\\nTokens utilisés: {response.usage.total_tokens} (prompt: {response.usage.prompt_tokens}, complétion: {response.usage.completion_tokens})\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Pattern RAG — Q&A sur document"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# AI-102: RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation)\n",
    "# Le contenu du document est injecté dans le prompt comme contexte\n",
    "# Le modèle répond en se basant UNIQUEMENT sur ce contexte\n",
    "\n",
    "# Simuler un document extrait par Document Intelligence\n",
    "document_content = \"\"\"\n",
    "CONTRAT DE PRESTATION DE SERVICES N° 2024-0156\n",
    "\n",
    "Entre:\n",
    "- La société TECH SOLUTIONS SAS, 15 rue de la Paix, 75001 Paris (Prestataire)\n",
    "- La société CLIENT CORP, 22 avenue Victor Hugo, 69001 Lyon (Client)\n",
    "\n",
    "Objet: Développement d'une application de gestion documentaire basée sur Azure AI Foundry.\n",
    "\n",
    "Durée: 6 mois à compter du 1er janvier 2024, jusqu'au 30 juin 2024.\n",
    "\n",
    "Budget total: 85 000 EUR HT.\n",
    "\n",
    "Modalités de paiement: 30% à la signature, 40% à mi-parcours, 30% à la livraison finale.\n",
    "\n",
    "Clause de confidentialité: Le prestataire s'engage à respecter la confidentialité de toutes\n",
    "les informations communiquées pendant la durée du contrat et pendant 3 ans après son terme.\n",
    "\"\"\"\n",
    "\n",
    "def rag_qa(document: str, question: str) -> str:\n",
    "    \"\"\"Pattern RAG: répond à une question en se basant sur le document fourni.\"\"\"\n",
    "    response = client.chat.completions.create(\n",
    "        model=CHAT_MODEL,\n",
    "        messages=[\n",
    "            {\n",
    "                \"role\": \"system\",\n",
    "                \"content\": \"\"\"Tu es un assistant expert en analyse de documents.\n",
    "Réponds aux questions en te basant UNIQUEMENT sur le contenu du document fourni.\n",
    "Si la réponse ne figure pas dans le document, dis-le explicitement.\n",
    "Cite la partie pertinente du document pour appuyer ta réponse.\"\"\"\n",
    "            },\n",
    "            {\n",
    "                \"role\": \"user\",\n",
    "                \"content\": f\"\"\"Document:\\n\\n{document}\\n\\n---\\n\\nQuestion: {question}\"\"\"\n",
    "            }\n",
    "        ],\n",
    "        max_tokens=400,\n",
    "        temperature=0.1  # Très bas pour réponses factuelles précises\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    return response.choices[0].message.content\n",
    "\n",
    "questions = [\n",
    "    \"Quel est le montant total du contrat?\",\n",
    "    \"Quelles sont les modalités de paiement?\",\n",
    "    \"Quelle est la durée de la clause de confidentialité?\",\n",
    "    \"Qui est le prestataire et où est-il situé?\"\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "for q in questions:\n",
    "    print(f\"Q: {q}\")\n",
    "    print(f\"R: {rag_qa(document_content, q)}\")\n",
    "    print(\"-\" * 60)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. Conversation multi-tours avec historique"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# AI-102: Gérer l'historique de conversation pour les dialogues multi-tours\n",
    "# L'historique complet est envoyé à chaque requête\n",
    "\n",
    "class DocumentChatbot:\n",
    "    def __init__(self, document: str):\n",
    "        self.history = []\n",
    "        self.system_prompt = f\"\"\"Tu es un assistant expert en analyse de documents.\n",
    "Réponds aux questions en te basant sur ce document:\n",
    "\n",
    "{document}\n",
    "\n",
    "Maintiens le contexte de la conversation.\"\"\"\n",
    "    \n",
    "    def chat(self, user_message: str) -> str:\n",
    "        self.history.append({\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": user_message})\n",
    "        \n",
    "        response = client.chat.completions.create(\n",
    "            model=CHAT_MODEL,\n",
    "            messages=[\n",
    "                {\"role\": \"system\", \"content\": self.system_prompt},\n",
    "                *self.history\n",
    "            ],\n",
    "            max_tokens=300,\n",
    "            temperature=0.3\n",
    "        )\n",
    "        \n",
    "        assistant_response = response.choices[0].message.content\n",
    "        self.history.append({\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": assistant_response})\n",
    "        return assistant_response\n",
    "\n",
    "bot = DocumentChatbot(document_content)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Simulation d'une conversation\n",
    "conversation = [\n",
    "    \"Qui sont les parties impliquées dans ce contrat?\",\n",
    "    \"Et quelle est leur relation dans ce contexte?\",\n",
    "    \"Combien coûte cette collaboration?\",\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "for message in conversation:\n",
    "    print(f\"👤 {message}\")\n",
    "    response = bot.chat(message)\n",
    "    print(f\"🤖 {response}\\n\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. Classification zero-shot"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# AI-102: Classification zero-shot avec JSON output\n",
    "# Utilise response_format pour forcer la sortie en JSON valide\n",
    "\n",
    "import json\n",
    "\n",
    "def classify_document(text: str) -> dict:\n",
    "    response = client.chat.completions.create(\n",
    "        model=CHAT_MODEL,\n",
    "        messages=[\n",
    "            {\"role\": \"system\", \"content\": \"Tu es un classificateur de documents. Réponds UNIQUEMENT en JSON valide.\"},\n",
    "            {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": f\"\"\"Classifie ce document:\n",
    "\n",
    "{text[:1500]}\n",
    "\n",
    "JSON attendu:\n",
    "{{\n",
    "  \"type\": \"contrat|facture|rapport|lettre|formulaire|autre\",\n",
    "  \"domain\": \"juridique|financier|médical|technique|commercial|RH|autre\",\n",
    "  \"language\": \"code ISO 639-1\",\n",
    "  \"formality\": \"formel|semi-formel|informel\",\n",
    "  \"topics\": [\"max 5 sujets\"],\n",
    "  \"confidence\": 0.0_à_1.0\n",
    "}}\"\"\"}\n",
    "        ],\n",
    "        max_tokens=300,\n",
    "        temperature=0.1,\n",
    "        response_format={\"type\": \"json_object\"}\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    return json.loads(response.choices[0].message.content)\n",
    "\n",
    "classification = classify_document(document_content)\n",
    "print(\"Classification du document:\")\n",
    "for key, value in classification.items():\n",
    "    print(f\"  {key}: {value}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. Génération d'embeddings"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# AI-102: Les embeddings sont des vecteurs numériques qui représentent le sens du texte\n",
    "# Des textes similaires ont des embeddings proches (cosine similarity élevée)\n",
    "# Utilisé pour la recherche sémantique, le clustering, la recommandation\n",
    "\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "\n",
    "def cosine_similarity(a: list, b: list) -> float:\n",
    "    a, b = np.array(a), np.array(b)\n",
    "    return float(np.dot(a, b) / (np.linalg.norm(a) * np.linalg.norm(b)))\n",
    "\n",
    "texts = [\n",
    "    \"Le contrat a été signé le 1er janvier 2024\",\n",
    "    \"L'accord contractuel date du début de l'année 2024\",  # Sémantiquement similaire\n",
    "    \"Le ciel est bleu aujourd'hui\",  # Non relié\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "response = client.embeddings.create(\n",
    "    model=EMBEDDING_MODEL,\n",
    "    input=texts\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "embeddings = [item.embedding for item in response.data]\n",
    "print(f\"Dimension des embeddings: {len(embeddings[0])} (ada-002)\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Calculer les similarités\n",
    "sim_12 = cosine_similarity(embeddings[0], embeddings[1])\n",
    "sim_13 = cosine_similarity(embeddings[0], embeddings[2])\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"\\nSimilarité texte 1 ↔ 2 (même sens): {sim_12:.3f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Similarité texte 1 ↔ 3 (sans rapport): {sim_13:.3f}\")\n",
    "print(\"\\nLes textes sémantiquement proches ont une similarité plus élevée.\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 6. Génération de document structuré"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# AI-102: Génération de documents professionnels avec prompt engineering\n",
    "\n",
    "def generate_document(doc_type: str, instructions: str, language: str = \"fr\") -> str:\n",
    "    response = client.chat.completions.create(\n",
    "        model=CHAT_MODEL,\n",
    "        messages=[\n",
    "            {\n",
    "                \"role\": \"system\",\n",
    "                \"content\": \"Tu es un rédacteur professionnel. Génère des documents bien structurés en Markdown.\"\n",
    "            },\n",
    "            {\n",
    "                \"role\": \"user\",\n",
    "                \"content\": f\"Génère un {doc_type} en {language}. Instructions: {instructions}\"\n",
    "            }\n",
    "        ],\n",
    "        max_tokens=800,\n",
    "        temperature=0.5\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    return response.choices[0].message.content\n",
    "\n",
    "doc = generate_document(\n",
    "    \"résumé exécutif\",\n",
    "    \"Résumer un projet de transformation digitale d'une PME utilisant Azure AI Foundry. Budget: 120k EUR. Durée: 12 mois.\"\n",
    ")\n",
    "print(doc)"
   ]
  }
